# Optional for manual local Apple sign-in, not needed by npm test or public API reads.
# Copy to .dev.vars, generate fresh local keys, then fill in the staging Apple details.
# Never use production credentials here. Do not commit .dev.vars.
SESSION_SECRET=""
TOKEN_ENCRYPTION_KEY=""
APPLE_TEAM_ID=""
APPLE_KEY_ID=""
# Full Sign in with Apple P8 PEM contents, not a filename/path.
# Keep BEGIN/END PRIVATE KEY lines; encode line breaks as \n in a double-quoted value.
# See docs/development.md for a complete example and diagnostic codes.
APPLE_PRIVATE_KEY=""
